             no other modification.

Do not describe the purchased packs as CC-BY: their licence forbids
redistribution, which CC-BY would permit. The CC-BY statement above applies
only to Serene Village (and only if that pack is used).

Credit placement
----------------
The office shows the active theme's credit; the persistent Credits/About entry
required by the plan must also name LimeZu with the link above, so the credit
does not depend on a theme being active.

Not used
--------
The free LimeZu pack is non-commercial only and is not used by Qubit Office.

